# Toolchain for an incident-analysis / digital-forensics dev container.
# Disk, memory, and malware/IOC tooling on top of the base command-line and
# desktop USE defaults.

# Disk / filesystem
*app-forensics/sleuthkit
*app-admin/testdisk
*app-forensics/foremost
*app-forensics/scalpel
*app-forensics/magicrescue
*sys-fs/dosfstools
*sys-fs/ntfs3g

# Imaging
*sys-apps/dcfldd
*app-forensics/memdump

# Memory forensics
*app-forensics/volatility3

# Malware / IOC
*app-forensics/yara
*app-forensics/yara-x
*app-antivirus/clamav

# Timeline / artifact parsing
*app-forensics/dfxml
*app-forensics/mac-robber
*app-forensics/rifiuti
*app-forensics/pasco
*app-forensics/galleta
*media-libs/exiftool

# Host integrity / rootkit checks
*app-forensics/rkhunter
*app-forensics/chkrootkit
*app-forensics/aide
*app-forensics/lynis

